            "review_title": "Review at Mien Banh Da Cua",
            "review_text": "Greg D\nGeneva, Switzerland59 contributions\n0\nInsane crab soup!!\nJul 2018\nOne of the best soup of my life!!\nJust ask the lady to put the crab paste into your soup, the taste of the broth combined with the noodles and the veggies is to die for...\nThe place is dirty just like all the street joints in Vietnam but the food is very clean.\nThe locals say that this is one of the best place to eat in Hanoi and i definitely agree!!Definitely worth it!!\nRead more\nWritten July 30, 2018",
