            "review_title": "Review at Mien Banh Da Cua",
            "review_text": "PausterS\n24 contributions\n0\nBest street food we had in Hanoi\nAug 2013\nThey only serve one dish, but this is the best soup I had in Hanoi: there's everything in it (spinach, noodles, meat, sausage, egg....) When you get your bowl you top it up with peanuts, soy sauce and chilli and enjoy!\nThey seem to be serving Vietnamese people first, but this soup is definitely worth waiting a while!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 23, 2013",
